        NavigationBar_NavButton__JwONn primary" data-testid="blox-button"><div class="Button_ButtonContent__qPyqO Button_ButtonContent-md__1XTQo"><div class="undefined Button_Text-md__R7FDU Button_BtnText__nrjra  primary " data-testid="text-custom">BOOK PROPERTY</div></div></div></div></div><div class="PropertyDetails_RelativeComponentCtn__xJB6K"><div class="PropertyDetails_BodyWrapper__xzEAL"><div class="PropertyDetails_leftSection__nwaCM"><section id="Overview"><div class="Overview_OverviewMain__jK_BF"><div class="Overview_Overview__Bc1p3 false" data-testid="blox-Overview"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm undefined Overview_HeadingTextOverview__4Xh33"><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Overview</div></h2><div class="Overview_OverviewData__cLXua"><div class="TruncatedText_TruncateText__iKHoI text-12 
            undefined
            undefined"><div class="undefined TruncatedText TruncatedText_line-4__CGy8m Overview_OverviewDescriptionTruncText__KLEw7 
                 " data-testid="text-custom">Welcome to this stunning and spacious property located in a highly desirable neighborhood. As you enter the home, you are greeted by a grand foyer with soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light. The open concept floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to the kitchen, you will find a cozy breakfast nook with large windows overlooking the beautifully landscaped backyard. The master bedroom suite is a true retreat, boasting a spacious layout, a private en-suite bathroom with a luxurious soaking tub, a separate walk-in shower, and a double vanity in Homes. Additionally, the master suite offers a generous walk-in closet, providing plenty of storage options. This property offers several versatile rooms that can be customized to fit your needs, such as a home office, a gym, or a guest suite. Additional highlights include hardwood flooring throughout, a private backyard oasis with a sparkling pool and a patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and hosting summer gatherings. This property offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and functionality in Homes.</div></div></div><div class="Overview_OverviewGrid__OKQXI false"><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Configuration</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">1 BHK</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Ready to move</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Completed in Dec 2022</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Avg. Price</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">₹22,000/sq.ft</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">RERA Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">399 - 540 sqft</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="Overview_ListContainer__RcPDE "><div class="Overview_highlightHeading__8JSvd">Why consider <span>buying this property</span>?</div><div class="Overview_HighlightsContainer__cYf_c"><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Stylist 1 RK and 1 BHK Homes.</li><li>Fully equipped modern kitchen with stainless steel appliances in Homes.</li><li>Private balcony offering an outdoor space for relaxation or enjoying city views.</li></ul><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Spacious and bright open-concept living and dining area with stunning city views.</li><li>Two generously sized bedrooms with bathrooms for added convenience.</li><li>Provides the ultimate urban living experience Homes.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="AIReviewSummary"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Container__cdZ_7 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Header__Z33Z1"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleWrapper__VrIqs"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleRow__RxyFc"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_Title__r4_AU"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">Google AI Summary</div></h2><span class="AIReviewSummary_Sparkle__4AIGg">✦</span></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_AiBadge__yHMUt"></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ContentWrapper__H1KTG" style="max-height:380px"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_SummaryText__LoG_f text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">The project is frequently cited for its strategic location near the Western Express Highway and the Dahisar East Metro station. Residents often mention the high construction quality and efficient layout of the 1BHK and 2BHK apartments. Google reviews highlight a well-maintained society with a quiet atmosphere despite being close to a busy highway. Many reviewers express satisfaction with the security measures and the professional management of the building. +1</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Grid__9zT79"><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="up-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The good things</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Connectivity</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The building is located very close to the Western Express Highway and multiple metro stations.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Construction Standards</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Owners frequently praise the sturdy build and high-quality interior finishes of the units.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Safety and Security</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project features robust security systems including CCTV and video door phones.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Basic Amenities</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Essential facilities such as a gymnasium, kids play area, and power backup are consistently functional.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Vastu Compliance</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Most units are designed according to Vastu principles which is highly appreciated by residents.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Natural Light</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Apartments are noted for having good ventilation and receiving ample natural sunlight.</div></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="down-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">Needs improvement</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Limited Open Space</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project is built on a relatively small plot of 0.41 acres resulting in limited outdoor green areas.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Highway Noise</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Units facing the Western Express Highway experience persistent traffic noise throughout the day.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Parking Constraints</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Some reviews indicate that the podium and basement parking areas can be tight for larger vehicles.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">High Maintenance</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Residents have occasionally pointed out that maintenance charges are higher compared to older societies in the vicinity.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Crowded Access</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The immediate approach road near the Dahisar Check Naka can become extremely congested during peak hours.</div></div></div></div></div><div><hr class="AIReviewSummary_Divider__md7XZ"/><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_VerdictLabel__jEfM0 text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The Verdict</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTags___OivB"><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Excellent for commuters</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">High construction quality</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Compact but functional</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Premium for the location</div></span></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_FadeOverlay__CFpBd" style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ToggleContainer__OfGS6 "><button class="AIReviewSummary_ViewMoreBtn__LXBrc"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_BtnText__a2mA5 text_mobile-cta__98PCA" data-testid="text-custom">REVEAL FULL SUMMARY</div><span class="AIReviewSummary_BtnIcon__HS5CT">✦</span><div class="AIReviewSummary_Shimmer__D9tsE"></div></button></div></div></section><section id="Amenities"><div class="Amenities_Amenities__Idw7g" data-testid="blox-Amenities"><div class="Amenities_AmmCard__Gu2e5 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="Amenities_AmenitiesHeadingTxt__bxyH0 squarebx rightPos"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm "><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Amenities</div></h2></div><div class="Amenities_amenitiesDesktop__NRcWU"><div class="Amenities_TagGrid__rI9__"><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/cctv-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg"/><div>CCTV / Video Surveillance</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/gym-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg"/><div>Gymnasium</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/clinic-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/clinic-secondary.svg"/><div>Home Automation</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/indoor-games-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg"/><div>Indoor Games</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/jogging-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="