",\"text\":\"Sanskruti Splendour is located at Sanskruti Splendour, opp. Gokul Anand Hotel, near Western express Highway, Dahisar East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400068.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What configurations are available in Sanskruti Splendour?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Sanskruti Splendour has 1 BHK configurations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the status of Sanskruti Splendour?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The status of Sanskruti Splendour is Ready to move.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which amenities are provided in Sanskruti Splendour?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Home Automation, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of Sanskruti Splendour?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of Sanskruti Splendour is Sanskruti Nirman.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Sanskruti Splendour\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/040823052708-newproject-2023-08-04t172655238.webp\",\n  \"description\": \"Welcome to this stunning and spacious property located in a highly desirable neighborhood. As you enter the home, you are greeted by a grand foyer with soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light. The open concept floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to the kitchen, you will find a cozy breakfast nook with large windows overlooking the beautifully landscaped backyard. The master bedroom suite is a true retreat, boasting a spacious layout, a private en-suite bathroom with a luxurious soaking tub, a separate walk-in shower, and a double vanity in Homes. Additionally, the master suite offers a generous walk-in closet, providing plenty of storage options. This property offers several versatile rooms that can be customized to fit your needs, such as a home office, a gym, or a guest suite. Additional highlights include hardwood flooring throughout, a private backyard oasis with a sparkling pool and a patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and hosting summer gatherings. This property offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and functionality in Homes.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"Sanskruti Nirman\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/sanskruti-splendour\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"8778000.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"11880000.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/sanskruti-splendour\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800009760\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/sanskruti-nirman-1a256b13a4652\",\n    \"name\": \"Sanskruti Nirman\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/sanskruti-splendour\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"Sanskruti Splendour\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/sanskruti-splendour\",\n      \"name\": \"Sanskruti Splendour\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Sanskruti Splendour, opp. Gokul Anand Hotel, near Western express Highway, Dahisar East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400068\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Dahisar East\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Mumbai\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"400068\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n      }\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Welcome to this stunning and spacious property located in a highly desirable neighborhood. As you enter the home, you are greeted by a grand foyer with soaring ceilings and an abundance of natural light. The open concept floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to the kitchen, you will find a cozy breakfast nook with large windows overlooking the beautifully landscaped backyard. The master bedroom suite is a true retreat, boasting a spacious layout, a private en-suite bathroom with a luxurious soaking tub, a separate walk-in shower, and a double vanity in Homes. Additionally, the master suite offers a generous walk-in closet, providing plenty of storage options. This property offers several versatile rooms that can be customized to fit your needs, such as a home office, a gym, or a guest suite. Additional highlights include hardwood flooring throughout, a private backyard oasis with a sparkling pool and a patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and hosting summer gatherings. This property offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and functionality in Homes.\",\n  \"floorSize\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"unitCode\": \"SQFT\",\n          \"minValue\": \"399\",\n          \"maxValue\": \"540\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"image\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n          \"url\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/040823052708-newproject-2023-08-04t172655238.webp\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"name\": \"Sanskruti Splendour\",\n  \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"@id\": \"P51800009760\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"name\": \"Sale of Sanskruti Splendour Unit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/sanskruti-splendour\",\n      \"price\": 8778000.00,\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\n"],"aiReviewSummary":{"summary":"The project is frequently cited for its strategic location near the Western Express Highway and the Dahisar East Metro station. Residents often mention the high construction quality and efficient layout of the 1BHK and 2BHK apartments. Google reviews highlight a well-maintained society with a quiet atmosphere despite being close to a busy highway. Many reviewers express satisfaction with the security measures and the professional management of the building. +1","pros":[{"title":"Connectivity","description":"The building is located very close to the Western Express Highway and multiple metro stations."},{"title":"Construction Standards","description":"Owners frequently praise the sturdy build and high-quality interior finishes of the units."},{"title":"Safety and Security","description":"The project features robust security systems including CCTV and video door phones."},{"title":"Basic Amenities","description":"Essential facilities such as a gymnasium, kids play area, and power backup are consistently functional."},{"title":"Vastu Compliance","description":"Most units are designed according to Vastu principles which is highly appreciated by residents."},{"title":"Natural Light","description":"Apartments are noted for having good ventilation and receiving ample natural sunlight."}],"cons":[{"title":"Limited Open Space","description":"The project is built on a relatively small plot of 0.41 acres resulting in limited outdoor green areas."},{"title":"Highway Noise","description":"Units facing the Western Express Highway experience persistent traffic noise throughout the day."},{"title":"Parking Constraints","description":"Some reviews indicate that the podium and basement parking areas can be tight for larger vehicles."},{"title":"High Maintenance","description":"Residents have occasionally pointed out that maintenance charges are higher compared to older societies in the vicinity."},{"title":"Crowded Access","description":"The immediate approach road near the Dahisar Check Naka can become extremely congested during peak hours."}],"verdict":["Excellent for commuters","High construction quality","Compact but functional","Premium for the location"]},"googleReviews":{"html_attributions":[],"result":{"rating":4.9,"reviews":[{"author_name":"Amol Gawde","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105350143753431103186/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVO9CaHL7MoxtKwsbCR2ljlT_UlT5U80Q31iAqjT-YfHq680WSb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8","rating":4,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"One of well known and well connected residential housing project , very much near by Western Express Highway.🛣️\nMacD , cake 🍰 shops, electrical shops 🏬, ATM machines outlets are also located in this building at ground level. Hospitals 🏥, schools 🏫 and other restaurants are also located very close to this building.","time":1749451231,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Sneha Budhan","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104056969465392980224/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXIv2LXMaINz6QzwkF5aAvbNMyDjOAZnZsg2KpdIhpMuLW77v6r=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 weeks ago","text":"Good food and service","time":1785574058,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Pooja Naiksatam","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102061359807902750933/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-9t6hLzPIsh9K8_-1obxlszNKJOFPcnPYfY3ua_JUfrdPTQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"Nice experience with good staff and quick services","time":1752246462,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Sachin Singh","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103565368474463651097/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-buQh_cs4WYk0PZ8qPd9ZlPELvuy6WzoJoPk0Q4oFZxX4SQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"Good environment and amazing service 💗🫶","time":1751983395,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Vaishnavi Tandel","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108915659959876586421/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKE6HujW4UQP8UYXO6mj99f_f0OamKF02hGox_GgFus-xb047M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"Good service and sweet spoken staff","time":1749826183,"translated":false}],"url":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=8731840811721997298","user_ratings_total":150},"status":"OK"}},"isMobile":false,"footerData":{"featured":{"kolkata":{"label":"Kolkata","id":14},"mumbai":{"label":"Mumbai","id":256},"navi-mumbai":{"label":"Navi Mumbai","id":261},"pune":{"label":"Pune","id":300},"thane":{"label":"Thane","id":269}},"others":{"alibaug":{"label":"Alibaug","id":1907},"bangalore":{"label":"Bangalore","id":95},"noida":{"label":"Noida","id":84},"palghar":{"label":"Palghar","id":264},"raigad":{"label":"Raigad","id":3323},"telangana":{"label":"Telangana","id":3326}}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/projects/[project_name]","query":{"project_name":"sanskruti-splendour"},"buildId":"t4LZHlTlBLViwyNa5GApO","isFallback":false,"gssp":true,"appGip":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>